  <!-- The character page: "What people say about them". -->
  <CC_Rep_PageTitle>What people say about {PAWN_objective}</CC_Rep_PageTitle>
  <CC_Rep_Known_Good>{PAWN_nameDef} is known to be {GOOD}.</CC_Rep_Known_Good>
  <CC_Rep_Known_Bad>{PAWN_nameDef} is said to be {BAD}.</CC_Rep_Known_Bad>
  <CC_Rep_Known_Both>{PAWN_nameDef} is known to be {GOOD}, though people also say {PAWN_pronoun} is {BAD}.</CC_Rep_Known_Both>
  <CC_Rep_Nothing>Nobody has much to say about {PAWN_objective} yet.</CC_Rep_Nothing>
  <CC_Rep_NothingSaid>nothing said</CC_Rep_NothingSaid>
  <CC_Rep_StandingTip>What the colony says about them, from the deeds people know of, side by side. A side shows from 6 and is strong from 18 (40 at most). It is shared out over everyone in the colony, so a name needs the story to have got round, and it fades as the talk dies down.</CC_Rep_StandingTip>
  <CC_Rep_Deed>{WHAT} ({LABEL}). {COUNT} of {ALL} have heard.</CC_Rep_Deed>
  <CC_Rep_Grown_Worse>It sounds worse every time it's told.</CC_Rep_Grown_Worse>
  <CC_Rep_Grown_Better>It has grown in the telling.</CC_Rep_Grown_Better>
  <CC_Rep_Grown_Softer>Most have heard a kinder version.</CC_Rep_Grown_Softer>
  <CC_Rep_Grown_Smaller>Most have heard less of it than it was.</CC_Rep_Grown_Smaller>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Inline>It went from {CHAIN}.</CC_Rep_Chain_Inline>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_To>to</CC_Rep_Chain_To>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Saw>Saw it: {0}.</CC_Rep_Chain_Saw>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Heard>{WHO} heard it from {FROM}, {HOW}.</CC_Rep_Chain_Heard>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Doubts>Not quite believed.</CC_Rep_Chain_Doubts>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Nobody>Nobody else knows of it yet.</CC_Rep_Chain_Nobody>
  <CC_Rep_Chain_Fades>Talk dies down: a deed is half forgotten after a month or a few, unless something new is heard.</CC_Rep_Chain_Fades>
