  <CC_Rep_Split_Tip>What each of the others makes of them from what they've heard and believe, weighed by their own character: the bold make more of courage, the warm of kindness and cruelty, the wary of a loose tongue. Someone whose good and bad cancel out is in neither list.</CC_Rep_Split_Tip>

